<title>SINGAPORE: Causeway first-half loss at S$0.91 mln.</title>
<headline>Causeway first-half loss at S$0.91 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>	   (in million of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			0.91   vs    1.42</p>
<p>    Group share loss (cents)  1.22   vs    2.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		     22.09   vs   17.41</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    0.22   vs    0.51</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss		  0.98   vs    1.04</p>
<p>    Tax			     0.12   vs    0.52</p>
<p>Note - Causeway Investment Ltd said due to difficult operating conditions, it did not foresee any significant improvement in results for the second half of the year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
